sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Requester or reviewer
    participant UI as Streamlit
    participant LG as LangGraph
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant GH as GitHub via MCP

    U->>UI: Submit an IT support ticket
    UI->>DB: Save ticket and assign local status New
    UI->>LG: Run the ticket workflow
    LG->>LG: Intake classifies the request with OpenAI

    alt Urgent, unclear or intake failed
        LG->>LG: Skip duplicate and knowledge checks
        LG->>LG: Route to Service Desk for review
    else Normal and clear
        LG->>LG: Search earlier tickets for possible duplicates
        LG->>LG: Retrieve articles and generate cited suggestions
        LG->>LG: Recommend a queue and decide if review is needed
    end

    LG->>DB: Save combined report and update local status
    LG-->>UI: Return classification, guidance and routing
    UI-->>U: Show saved results in the ticket queue

    opt Review required and reviewer chooses to escalate
        U->>UI: Open and review the GitHub issue draft
        alt Reviewer approves publication
            U->>UI: Approve and create GitHub issue
            UI->>DB: Reserve one creation attempt for this ticket
            UI->>GH: Call issue_write with method create
            alt GitHub returns a confirmed issue link
                GH-->>UI: Return issue link
                UI->>DB: Save the link and creation status
                UI-->>U: Show Open GitHub issue
                opt Reviewer requests latest details
                    U->>UI: Click Read latest GitHub details
                    UI->>GH: Call issue_read with method get
                    GH-->>UI: Return current issue state and details
                    UI-->>U: Display issue details
                end
            else Creation cannot be confirmed
                UI->>DB: Record uncertain status
                UI-->>U: Block repeat creation and ask reviewer to check GitHub
            end
        else Reviewer leaves draft unapproved
            UI-->>U: Keep the ticket in local review
        end
    end
